h 18 exposure lines and 12 delegator lines and names her as a reviewer, which fails the criterion. It also gives no departed share and does not merge Scholz or LeFnord.\", \"pass\": false}]}","ttft_ms":12514,"type":"result","duration_ms":12540,"uuid":"652ed7ad-1999-420c-a470-4096ec9f616b","ttft_stream_ms":1786,"time_to_request_ms":468,"first_content_frame_ms":1786,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
